# Seeded by brakes (security); this file is the project's from now on.
# A root .semgrepignore replaces Semgrep's built-in default ignore list; it does
# not extend it. The block below restates the defaults of Semgrep CE 1.182.0
# (src/targeting/default.semgrepignore), so `sast` scans what it scanned before
# this file existed. These entries need no inventory entry; any other path added
# here is a bypass and needs an `allowlist` entry whose target is
# `.semgrepignore#<path>` (docs/agent-setup/security-gates.md).

# Administrative folder or file used by popular version control systems
.git
.svn
.hg
_darcs
CVS

# Paths to files and folders that are typically large and ignorable
build/
vendor/
dist/
*.min.js
.env/
.tox/

# Package managers
node_modules/
.npm/
.yarn/
.venv/
_opam/
_build/
_cargo/

# Common test paths
test/
tests/
testsuite/
*_test.go
